title: "JupyterHub Container Deploy"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-18"
abstract: >-
  A Flask service that manages JupyterHub LXD containers on the FRESH lab host:
  it creates, starts, stops, archives, and restores hubs, and publishes each one
  on a host port.
